- loudness_tolerance_lu 0.5, true_peak_margin_db 0.2;
- alignment_max_ms 2;
- page_pitch_from_median_semitones 1.5, pitch_spread_max_semitones 2.6;
- voiced_below_peak_db 40 and mouth_percentiles [25, 90], fitted together on chapter 1;
- music_mood_percentiles {quiet 10, lively 75}, music_mood_band_lu 2, section_change_db 3 and section_snap_seconds 12 (tuned on log 32's 216 s);
- fade_in_without_onset_seconds 2.0;
- invented: alignment_match_min 0.8.

**budget_planner** (11 entries: 9 judged, 2 invented):
- repaint_share 0.5, rerecord_reserve_pages 1;
- stretch_margin_minutes 10, restart_loss_max_seconds 900, piece_frames_min 60;
- busy_machine_factor 1.8, film_copies 2, disk_free_reserve_gb 4, stalled_after_piece_times 2;
- invented: piece_load_share_max 0.10 and memory_reserve_gb 2.

The tools also read existing entries in timing, sound, filming, money, script, delivery and frame. I changed no other section.

